Relationship to CUE4Parse:

  wuwa-pak is an independent Python implementation. It does not include
  CUE4Parse C# source files verbatim, but parts of its Wuthering Waves Pak entry
  decoding and partial encryption behavior were implemented with reference to
  CUE4Parse's Apache-2.0 licensed implementation.

  The referenced upstream behavior includes Wuthering Waves Pak entry bitfield
  decoding, the custom entry byte, offset/uncompressed-size swapping, and partial
  encryption length handling.

